<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>

    <!-- One footer, called by every student-facing template.

         Written once rather than pasted into eleven templates in three
         languages each. Thirty-three copies of a phone number is thirty-three
         places to miss when it changes, and the studio has already been
         caught out by stale contact details reaching students.

         Callers set notice_lang before calling, because the language lives on
         a different field per model - student_id.lang on a booking, lang on a
         trial request - and the footer should not have to know which model it
         is being rendered under.

             <t t-set="notice_lang" t-value="object.student_id.lang"/>
             <t t-call="fitness_notifications.mail_footer_no_reply"/>

         Why it exists: replies to these emails go to info@corelabstudio.es,
         which Odoo does not read - there is no incoming mail server and no
         catchall alias, confirmed on production. A student who replies is
         answered by whatever that mailbox does on its own, and is not heard
         by the studio through the app at all. So the footer sends her
         somewhere that is actually read. -->
    <template id="mail_footer_no_reply" name="CoreLab: no-reply footer">
        <t t-set="_l" t-value="notice_lang or 'es_ES'"/>
        <div style="margin:22px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #E4DFD8;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6B615B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">
            <t t-if="_l == 'en_US'">
                <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>Please do not reply to this email.</strong> This address is not monitored, so a reply will not reach us.</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">To talk to the studio:</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">&#183; <a href="https://app.corelabstudio.es/my/messages" style="color:#4A7FA5;text-decoration:underline;">Messages in the app</a></p>
                <p style="margin:0;">&#183; WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/34628139121" style="color:#4A7FA5;text-decoration:underline;">+34 628 13 91 21</a></p>
            </t>
            <t t-elif="_l == 'ca_ES'">
                <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>Si us plau, no responguis a aquest correu.</strong> Aquesta adre&#231;a no es llegeix, aix&#237; que la teva resposta no ens arribar&#224;.</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">Per parlar amb l&#39;estudi:</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">&#183; <a href="https://app.corelabstudio.es/my/messages" style="color:#4A7FA5;text-decoration:underline;">Missatges a l&#39;app</a></p>
                <p style="margin:0;">&#183; WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/34628139121" style="color:#4A7FA5;text-decoration:underline;">+34 628 13 91 21</a></p>
            </t>
            <t t-else="">
                <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>Por favor, no respondas a este correo.</strong> Esta direcci&#243;n no se lee, as&#237; que tu respuesta no nos llegar&#225;.</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">Para hablar con el estudio:</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">&#183; <a href="https://app.corelabstudio.es/my/messages" style="color:#4A7FA5;text-decoration:underline;">Mensajes en la app</a></p>
                <p style="margin:0;">&#183; WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/34628139121" style="color:#4A7FA5;text-decoration:underline;">+34 628 13 91 21</a></p>
            </t>
        </div>
    </template>

</odoo>
